Z||000001||terryk||08-10-2001||03:19 PM||||An hour if you've never done it. Follow the manual EXACTLY or you will lose either your rear window or FINGERS.<P>Have some 2x4 pieces available.||||reg||4
Z||000002||KRMFiero||08-10-2001||04:37 PM||||it will take seconds to get them off, undow bolts on decklid, take decklid off, undo bolts holding hinge on and BANG they come right off, even helps you remove your rear window  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>Yes when i took my deklid springs off i didnt realise they were that strong heh... I cant see more the 2 hours taking your time being ver caushious||||reg||1
